    ],
    "mechanism": "Empty SET_VAR restoration is not a mutation: preserve the generation and parsed optimizer fix-control. Actual overlay restoration still mutates and invalidates. Installing server-version identity increments generation because cached statement vars include VERSION(). No workload-specific branch or new cache.",
